{
    "title": "NBC 5 Dallas-Fort Worth News",
    "description": "The NBC 5 Dallas-Fort Worth news and weather app connects you with your local news, local weather and a free, 24/7 streaming news channel. Free to download and to use, the app delivers North Texas breaking news alerts and weather alerts for your location that can be customized and easily managed in the app settings. \r\n\r\nThe app gives you access to DFW local news from the award-winning NBC 5 DFW news team, covering the issues and concerns most important to residents in North Texas. The NBC 5 Weather Experts deliver accurate local forecasts that keep app users safe and informed while on the go. Access a powerful weather radar and customize the weather screen based on your preferences. \r\n\r\nDALLAS-FORT WORTH WEATHER\r\n+ Customizable weather home screen with weather modules you can rearrange \r\n+ Upgraded location hub to add new locations and set up weather alerts \r\n+ The only live S-Band weather radar in North Texas\r\n+Exclusive weather coverage from Texas Thunder Truck and Texas StormRanger\u2019s X Band radar\r\n+ 10-day forecasts from the NBC 5 Weather Experts for your region of North Texas\r\n+ Hourly forecasts featuring a customizable graph \r\n+ Detailed forecast data that includes UV index and air quality in North Texas\r\n+ Weather alerts for every location you save in the app\r\n+ Hurricane warnings and storm tracker \r\n+ Complete weather closings for DFW schools\r\n+ Weather news videos from your local meteorologists\r\n\r\nDFW NEWS ALERTS\r\n+ Alerts for DFW local news, national headlines and world news that can be personalized and managed in the app settings\r\nTop news of the day, covering breaking news, politics, weather and urgent product recalls \r\n+ Latest news feed that shows all articles and videos published in reverse chronological order\r\n+ Alerts center that shows you the most urgent DFW stories of the day that you might\u2019ve missed if you didn\u2019t click on push notifications\r\n+Trending section where you can discover daily, buzz-worthy topics in DFW local news and pop culture\r\n\r\nNBC DFW NEWS 24/7 STREAMING CHANNEL\r\n+ Free 24/7 streaming channel for nonstop local North Texas news, weather and special coverage around the clock, wherever you are\r\n+ Live NBC 5 DFW newscasts \r\n+ Breaking news live coverage of news briefings and other urgent news events in North Texas\r\n+ Dedicated video page with the latest video feed   \r\n\r\nNBC 5 DFW I-TEAM INVESTIGATIONS & MORE\r\n+ Award-winning NBC 5 investigative stories that get results\r\n+ NBC 5 Responds reports on recovering your money\r\n+ Submission platform for your news and weather photos\r\n+ Sports news from NBC Sports Regional Sports Networks\r\n+ Business news and financial insights from CNBC\r\n+ Entertainment news from E! Online\r\n+ Lifestyle and entertainment news from NBC TODAY Show\r\n\r\nThe NBC 5 Dallas-Fort Worth news and weather app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which will allow you to contribute to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please see www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.\r\n\r\nYour Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?brandA=Owned_Stations&intake=NBC_5_Dallas-Fort_Worth/  \r\nCA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=NBC_5_Dallas_Fort_Worth",
